<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $41-7/8 (FIM 188.66).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $41-7/8 (FIM 188.66).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADS closed $0-1/4 higher at $41-7/8 in New York on Monday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 188.66 markka. In Helsinki on Monday Nokia closed up 3.50 markka at 188.50.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADS (two shares) was unchanged at $33-1/4 on Wall Street overnight. The price equals about 74.90 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 0.80 markka to 75.80.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADS fell $0-1/8 to $20-7/8 (94.05 markka) on Monday in New York. In Helsinki, Rauma closed 0.50 markka lower at 94.50.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
